<title>USA: Huntington to acquire Citi-Bancshares.</title>
<headline>Huntington to acquire Citi-Bancshares.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huntington Bancshares Inc and Citi-Bancshares Inc issued a statement Friday announcing the acquisition of Citi-Bancshares by Huntington.</p>
<p>The statement said the parties signed a definitive merger agreement saying shareholders of Citi-Bancshares will receive $30 per share in the merger.  </p>
<p>Subject to certain limitations, shareholders may elect $30 in Huntington Common Stock, $30 in cash, or a combination consisting of $18 of Huntington Stock and $12 cash, the statement said.</p>
<p>This transaction is intended to be tax free to those shareholders of Citi-Bancshares who elect to receive stock in the transaction, the statement said.</p>
</text>
